From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] reflection: preserve byref TypeSpecs when resolving tokens.

Module.ResolveType and ResolveMember resolve TypeSpecs through MonoClass
and return its byval_arg. This loses the byref bit: a TypeSpec signature
ELEMENT_TYPE_BYREF ELEMENT_TYPE_U1 resolves to System.Byte, not Byte&.

Purple's startup code uses such a token to read bytes through a reference.
With the byref bit lost, it converts the address to a byte instead of
dereferencing it. Its module name decoding then fails, eventually passing
IntPtr.Zero to Marshal.GetDelegateForFunctionPointer. The null-pointer
exception is correct; the earlier type resolution is not.

Use Mono's existing type resolver for non-dynamic TypeSpecs, as ldtoken
already does. Preserve the byref bit when that resolver canonicalizes an
inflated generic type as well. Keep the existing token validation,
TypeDef/TypeRef handling, and dynamic-image handling unchanged.

Based on wine-mono/mono 775a29a0d864061a40438e38830c0afaadf9ae79
(Wine-Mono 11.2.0). No application-specific checks or exceptions are changed.
---
diff --git a/mono/metadata/class.c b/mono/metadata/class.c
--- a/mono/metadata/class.c
+++ b/mono/metadata/class.c
@@ -2938,7 +2938,9 @@ mono_type_get_checked (MonoImage *image, guint32 type_token, MonoGenericContext *co
 
 	if (inflated) {
 		MonoType *tmp = type;
+		MonoClass *klass = mono_class_from_mono_type_internal (type);
+
-		type = m_class_get_byval_arg (mono_class_from_mono_type_internal (type));
+		type = tmp->byref ? m_class_get_this_arg (klass) : m_class_get_byval_arg (klass);
 		/* FIXME: This is a workaround fo the fact that a typespec token sometimes reference to the generic type definition.
 		 * A MonoClass::_byval_arg of a generic type definion has type CLASS.
 		 * Some parts of mono create a GENERICINST to reference a generic type definition and this generates confict with _byval_arg.
diff --git a/mono/metadata/icall.c b/mono/metadata/icall.c
--- a/mono/metadata/icall.c
+++ b/mono/metadata/icall.c
@@ -6338,6 +6338,12 @@ module_resolve_type_token (MonoImage *image, guint32 token, MonoArrayHandle type_ar
 	}
 
 	init_generic_context_from_args_handles (&context, type_args, method_args);
+	if (table == MONO_TABLE_TYPESPEC) {
+		/* A MonoClass cannot distinguish T from T&. */
+		result = mono_type_get_checked (image, token, &context, error);
+		goto leave;
+	}
+
 	klass = mono_class_get_checked (image, token, error);
 	if (klass)
 		klass = mono_class_inflate_generic_class_checked (klass, &context, error);
